{"parse":{"title":"Echo of Winter Daydreams","pageid":477542,"revid":2189526,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Echo of Winter Daydreams</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034025\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Echo of Winter Daydreams\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034025\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034025 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034025 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Echo of Winter Daydreams\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Echo of Winter Daydreams.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shows the locations of <a href=\"/wiki/Snezhnaya_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snezhnaya Local Specialty\">Snezhnaya's Local Specialties</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Mini-map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mini-map\">mini-map</a>.<br />Practicing dance in one's spare time might even trigger other effects...</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Effects_Retained_Character_Fallen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Effects Retained Character Fallen\">Effects Retained Character Fallen</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resource\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resource\">Resource</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Local_Specialty\" title=\"Local Specialty\">Local Specialty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Snezhnaya_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snezhnaya Local Specialty\">Snezhnaya Local Specialty</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Echo of Winter Daydreams</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEcho_of_Winter_Daydreams%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Odette must be in the active party for Echo of Winter Daydreams to take effect, but she does not need to be alive.</li>\n<li>Only one local specialty will be shown on the mini-map at a time.</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li>\n<li>The following <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talent</a> is identical to this talent:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Treetop_Watch\" title=\"Treetop Watch\"><img alt=\"Treetop Watch\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Treetop Watch.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Treetop_Watch.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Talent_Treetop_Watch.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260812034040\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Treetop_Watch\" title=\"Treetop Watch\"><img alt=\"Treetop Watch\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Treetop Watch.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Treetop_Watch.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Talent_Treetop_Watch.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260812034040\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Treetop_Watch\" title=\"Treetop Watch\">Treetop Watch</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Alyosha\" title=\"Alyosha\">Alyosha</a>)</li></ul></li>\n<li>When Odette is in her dancing idle animation, her <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Skill\" title=\"Elemental Skill\">Elemental Skill</a> is replaced by a button that can be tapped repeatedly to extend her dance.\n<ul><li>Tapping her Elemental Skill will add additional <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/pirouette\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:pirouette\">pirouettes</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/fouett%C3%A9\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:fouetté\">fouettés</a> to her performance, extending her idle animation to a maximum of ~30s.</li>\n<li>While in Snezhnaya, during Odette's dancing idle animation, a variation of a section of <a href=\"/wiki/File:Character_Trailer_-_%22Odette-_An_Elegy_for_Innocence%22\" title=\"File:Character Trailer - &quot;Odette- An Elegy for Innocence&quot;\">Odette's Character Trailer</a> theme plays.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Preview\">Preview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEcho_of_Winter_Daydreams%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Talent_Local_Specialty_Map-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png\" title=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png (77 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/93/Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20210820071226\" title=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png (77 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png (77 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/93/Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20210820071226\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEcho_of_Winter_Daydreams%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"4f4aa5a85aac78d4630abfbb927c319f\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:66px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Icon_Hand_Small-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:64px; width:65px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_Hand_Small.png\" title=\"Icon Hand Small.png (5 KB)\" style=\"height:64px; width:65px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Icon_Hand_Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20230909194912\" title=\"Icon Hand Small.png (5 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Icon\" height=\"64\" width=\"65\" data-image-name=\"Icon Hand Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Hand_Small.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Icon\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Icon Hand Small.png (5 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Icon\" height=\"64\" width=\"65\" data-image-name=\"Icon Hand Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Hand_Small.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Icon\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Icon_Hand_Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20230909194912\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Icon</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEcho_of_Winter_Daydreams%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The name of her Utility Passive is a reference to <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symphony_No._1_(Tchaikovsky)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Symphony No. 1 (Tchaikovsky)\">Winter Daydreams</a></i> (Symphony No. 1 in G Minor) by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyotr_Ilyich_Tchaikovsky\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky\">Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEcho_of_Winter_Daydreams%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Echo of Winter Daydreams</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">回响中的冬梦</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Huíxiǎng-zhōng de Dōngmèng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Winter Dreams In Echoes</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">迴響中的冬夢</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Huíxiǎng-zhōng de Dōngmèng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">こだまする冬の夢</span><br /><small><i>Kodama-suru Fuyu no Yume</i></small></td><td>Echoing Winter Dreams</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">겨울꿈의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">메아리</span><br /><small><i>Gyeoulkkumui Meari</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Eco del sue<span lang=\"es\">ñ</span>o invernal</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">É</span>cho du r<span lang=\"fr\">ê</span>ve d'hiver</td><td>Echo of the Winter Dream</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Отголоски</span> <span lang=\"ru\">зимних</span> <span lang=\"ru\">снов</span><br /><small><i>Otgoloski zimnikh snov</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Echo of Winter Daydreams</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Giấc Mộng Mùa Đông Trong Tiếng Vọng</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td>